<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Tutorial on JustinFX.com</title><link>https://justinfx.com/tags/tutorial/</link><description>Recent content in Tutorial on JustinFX.com</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>Justin Israel. All rights reserved.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 22 Mar 2017 22:39:43 +1300</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://justinfx.com/tags/tutorial/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Python Video Tutorials Released Free</title><link>https://justinfx.com/2017/03/22/python-tutorials-released-free/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Mar 2017 22:39:43 +1300</pubDate><guid>https://justinfx.com/2017/03/22/python-tutorials-released-free/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In 2011 and 2012 I had released 3 commercial Python training tutorials, using Maya as a target platform.&#10;Now enjoy them free of charge!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tutorial: PyQt4 UI Development for Maya</title><link>https://justinfx.com/2012/10/12/pyqt4-for-maya/</link><pubDate>Fri, 12 Oct 2012 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justinfx.com/2012/10/12/pyqt4-for-maya/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.cmivfx.com/tutorials/view/498/PyQt4&amp;#43;UI&amp;#43;Development&amp;#43;for&amp;#43;Maya" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-525" title="PyQt4 for Maya" src="https://justinfx.com/uploads/2012/10/1350054625_Master.jpeg" alt="" width="800" height="450" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h1 id="pyqt4-ui-development-for-maya" class="relative group"&gt;PyQt4 UI Development for Maya &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#pyqt4-ui-development-for-maya" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just released my 3rd python-based online training video through &lt;a href="https://cmivfx.com/store/498-pyqt4&amp;#43;ui&amp;#43;development&amp;#43;for&amp;#43;maya" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;cmiVFX.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="introduction" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#introduction" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&#10;This tutorial is about learning PyQt4 python bindings for the Qt Framework, and how to introduce new UI elements to Maya as a platform.&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Python for Maya Artists – Volume 2</title><link>https://justinfx.com/2011/11/15/python-for-maya-artists-volume-2/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Nov 2011 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justinfx.com/2011/11/15/python-for-maya-artists-volume-2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cmivfx.com/store/328-python-for-maya-vol-02" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;img class="alignnone" src="https://justinfx.com/uploads/2011/11/maya_python_vol2.jpg" alt="" width="60%" height="60%" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Second video in the python for maya series, just released through &lt;a href="http://www.cmivfx.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;cmiVFX&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="python-for-maya--volume-2" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;a href="https://cmivfx.com/store/328-python-for-maya-vol-02" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Python For Maya – Volume 2&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#python-for-maya--volume-2" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you watched the first video, you now have a good grasp on Python. Sweet. Let’s plow through some more involved concepts like python juggernauts!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Intro to Python for Maya Artists – Tutorial</title><link>https://justinfx.com/2011/10/08/intro-to-python-for-maya-artists-tutorial/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Oct 2011 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justinfx.com/2011/10/08/intro-to-python-for-maya-artists-tutorial/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cmivfx.com/python-introduction-vol-01---maya" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;img class="alignnone" alt="" src="https://justinfx.com/uploads/2011/10/1318089294_Python_Background_master.jpg" width="60%" height="60%" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Just released my first online video tutorial, through &lt;a href="http://www.cmivfx.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;cmiVFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="python-introduction-vol-01--maya" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;a href="http://cmivfx.com/store/320-Python&amp;#43;Introduction&amp;#43;Vol&amp;#43;01&amp;#43;-&amp;#43;Maya" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Python Introduction Vol 01 – Maya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#python-introduction-vol-01--maya" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;